      "prose": {
        "text": "I take position (A) Four days in the office.\n\nOne reason is that the data from GitLab, a company that is remote by construction, suggests that in-person collaboration can have a positive impact on productivity and performance, particularly in terms of ramp-time and time to productivity.",
