      "p_a_canonical": 0.38514314868860683,
      "prose": {
        "text": "I take position (B) Fully remote.\n\nHere's one reason:\n\n\"Fully remote\" allows employees to create their own schedules and work environments, which can lead to improved work-life balance and reduced burnout.",
