      "p_a_canonical": 0.25408339875929004,
      "prose": {
        "text": "I hold the position of \"Four days in the office\".\n\nHere's one reason why:\n\n\"Four days in the office\" is the best option because it allows for a balance between flexibility and collaboration, enabling employees to work from home for one day and still have opportunities for in-person interactions and knowledge-sharing on the other four days.",
